  "recreation_notes": [
    {
      "line_end": 8,
      "line_start": 1,
      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "Barracora / IPD No. 177 / September, 1981 / 4 Players\nVersion 2.0 by UnclePaulie 2022\nTable nearly completely done from scratch.  Only reuse was from Dids 1.2 VPX version was plastic images, apron image, and upper gate prims.\nTable includes Hybrid VR/desktop/cabinet modes, new upscaled playfield, VPW physics, Fleep sounds, Lampz, 3D inserts, new GI, sling corrections, targets, saucers, playfield mesh, etc.\nSignificant time was spent on researching online videos, to ensure accuracy of shots, ball drops, kickouts, playability.\n\t2.1 version has updated playfield and plastics done by redbone.\nComplete implementation details found at the bottom of the script."
    }
  ],
